// Shareable、内部可变与受信任声明：评审 R5 的 Arc 条件
opaque class Arc<T>(p: RawPtr<T>) trusted Shareable if T: Shareable, T: Transferable trusted Transferable if T: Shareable, T: Transferable trusted Escapable if T: Escapable trusted Forgettable yes trusted ImplicitDrop yes
opaque class Mutex<T>(cell: RawCell<T>) trusted Shareable if T: Transferable trusted Transferable if T: Transferable trusted Escapable yes trusted EarlyDrop if T: EarlyDrop trusted Forgettable if T: Forgettable trusted ImplicitDrop if T: ImplicitDrop
opaque class Atomic(cell: RawCell<Int>) trusted Shareable yes trusted Transferable yes trusted Escapable yes trusted EarlyDrop yes trusted Forgettable yes trusted ImplicitDrop yes
class Cell<T>(cell: RawCell<T>)
class Config(name: String, limit: Int)
class Counter(hits: Cell<Int>)
view class Reader(borrow c: Config)
view class Writer(inout c: Config)
view class CellReader(borrow c: Counter)
expect Shareable Config = yes
expect Shareable RawCell<Int> = no
expect Shareable Cell<Int> = no
expect Transferable Cell<Int> = yes
expect Shareable Counter = no
expect why Shareable Counter = Counter.hits -> Cell<Int>.cell -> RawCell<Int>（不满足 Shareable）
expect Shareable Atomic = yes
expect Shareable Mutex<Cell<Int>> = yes
expect Shareable Mutex<Rc<Int>> = no
expect Shareable Arc = if T: Shareable, T: Transferable
expect Transferable Arc<Config> = yes
expect Transferable Arc<Cell<Int>> = no
expect Shareable Arc<Mutex<Cell<Int>>> = yes
expect Transferable Arc<Mutex<Rc<Int>>> = no
expect Transferable Reader = yes
expect Transferable CellReader = no
expect why Transferable CellReader = CellReader.c -> borrow<Counter> -> Counter.hits -> Cell<Int>.cell -> RawCell<Int>（不满足 Shareable）
expect Transferable Writer = yes
expect Copyable Reader = yes
expect Copyable Writer = no
expect Escapable Reader = no
expect Escapable Config = yes
